Subject: [PATCH 1943/3799] soh: rename func_80091738 -> Player_LoadPauseModel

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: DMAs gameplay_keep and the age-appropriate link object into a caller-supplied segment and inits the skeleton -- called only by kaleido with pauseCtx->playerSegment
Defined in soh/src/code/z_player_lib.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/include/functions.h                                       | 2 +-
 soh/src/code/z_player_lib.c                                   | 3 ++-
 soh/src/overlays/misc/ovl_kaleido_scope/z_kaleido_scope_PAL.c | 2 +-
 3 files changed, 4 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

